      "text": "src/app/(payload)/api/[...slug]/route.ts\nPOST /api/users  (register, public)\nPOST /api/users/login | logout | refresh-token\nPOST /api/users/forgot-password | reset-password\nGET | POST /api/user-valuables?depth=3\nGET /api/providers/:id?depth=1\nGET /api/media/file/:filename  (images + .glb)\n+ CRUD for every collection (access-controlled)",
