      "locked": false,
      "text": "src/app/(payload)/api/geo/**/route.ts  (11 handlers)\nrequire ?latitude&longitude (except categories)\nGET categories · categories/top  (4 + \"More\")\nGET sites/closest · sites/random · sites/by-id/:id\nGET valuables/closest · random · by-id/:id\nGET valuables/by-site | by-provider | by-category/:id\nGET valuables/by-tag/:tag\npublic: no JWT needed (read access is open)",
      "originalText": "src/app/(payload)/api/geo/**/route.ts  (11 handlers)\nrequire ?latitude&longitude (except categories)\nGET categories · categories/top  (4 + \"More\")\nGET sites/closest · sites/random · sites/by-id/:id\nGET valuables/closest · random · by-id/:id\nGET valuables/by-site | by-provider | by-category/:id\nGET valuables/by-tag/:tag\npublic: no JWT needed (read access is open)",
