      "text": "isProviderOrAdmin · isAdmin · isAdminField\npublic read: media, categories, providers, sites, valuables\nwrite categories/providers/sites/valuables:\n    provider | admin  (no ownership check)\nusers: create public · read/update self, admin all\n    role: create/update admin-only\nuser-valuables: read own · create any logged-in user\n    update/delete admin only\nmedia write: provider | admin",
      "originalText": "isProviderOrAdmin · isAdmin · isAdminField\npublic read: media, categories, providers, sites, valuables\nwrite categories/providers/sites/valuables:\n    provider | admin  (no ownership check)\nusers: create public · read/update self, admin all\n    role: create/update admin-only\nuser-valuables: read own · create any logged-in user\n    update/delete admin only\nmedia write: provider | admin",
