      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 560448351,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1463548952,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763164800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[1] Register: app POST /api/users -> Payload mails a verify link (Gmail)\n      -> user opens /verify-email -> account verified\n[2] Login: POST /api/users/login -> {token, exp, user} -> TokenStorage;\n      every call sends Authorization: JWT, refresh when < 5 min left\n[3] Discover: hook reads GPS -> GET /api/geo/...?latitude&longitude\n      -> $geoNear on MongoDB -> docs (depth 2) + distance in metres\n[4] Media: images + .glb loaded straight from /api/media/file/*\n      (MediaModel.fullUrl) -> streamed from ./media\n[5] Collect: POST /api/user-valuables {valuable, price, paymentMethod}\n      -> hook sets user, status Pending (no payment provider yet)\n[6] Reset password: POST forgot-password -> mail -> /reset-password\n      page -> POST /api/users/reset-password\n[7] Content: provider/admin edits in /admin -> MongoDB + ./media",
      "originalText": "[1] Register: app POST /api/users -> Payload mails a verify link (Gmail)\n      -> user opens /verify-email -> account verified\n[2] Login: POST /api/users/login -> {token, exp, user} -> TokenStorage;\n      every call sends Authorization: JWT, refresh when < 5 min left\n[3] Discover: hook reads GPS -> GET /api/geo/...?latitude&longitude\n      -> $geoNear on MongoDB -> docs (depth 2) + distance in metres\n[4] Media: images + .glb loaded straight from /api/media/file/*\n      (MediaModel.fullUrl) -> streamed from ./media\n[5] Collect: POST /api/user-valuables {valuable, price, paymentMethod}\n      -> hook sets user, status Pending (no payment provider yet)\n[6] Reset password: POST forgot-password -> mail -> /reset-password\n      page -> POST /api/users/reset-password\n[7] Content: provider/admin edits in /admin -> MongoDB + ./media",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
