      "text": "- providers can edit any site/valuable/category (no ownership)\n- user-valuables: price/status client-supplied, no real payment\n- uploads on local disk; Firebase bucket orphaned\n- app base URL is a hard-coded LAN IP over cleartext HTTP",
      "originalText": "- providers can edit any site/valuable/category (no ownership)\n- user-valuables: price/status client-supplied, no real payment\n- uploads on local disk; Firebase bucket orphaned\n- app base URL is a hard-coded LAN IP over cleartext HTTP",
